criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
signed informed consent to participate in the study;
participation in the three-week inpatient occupational dermatology maintenance program at the Institute for Interdisciplinary Dermatological Prevention and Rehabilitation at the Osnabrück University; 
adequate German language skills to comprehend the app content and complete the questionnaires;
access to a smartphone with internet capability
Exclusion criteria:
Insufficient knowledge of the German language
